            "pages": {
              "end": 28,
              "start": 28
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "California\u2019s three\u2011strikes statute sets a maximum three\u2011year prison term for grand theft."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "64b94292e9cdf451c9b7f6881964c624f5f8b66c93a8ca6854fb0d6da152c48c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-64b94292e9cd-0001-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 33,
              "start": 33
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Under the statute, if a defendant has two prior felonies that meet the statutory definition of \u201cserious or violent,\u201d any new felony triggers the three\u2011strike sentence."
      }
    ],
